  "body": "There is a moment each evening when the city skyline begins to glow. From this brand new Takapuna residence, that moment is all yours.\r\n \r\nElevated views. Soaring ceilings. Skylights that fill the home with light. This is a home for those ready to live beautifully, without the weekend chores.\r\n\r\nApproximately 252 sq m of refined living on a freehold site of approximately 260 sq m, standalone and brand new. The living spaces rise to meet you, with engineered oak underfoot and natural light streaming from above, while air conditioning keeps everything just right, whatever the season.\r\n \r\nAnd here is the detail that changes everything: a private lift between the two levels. Easy today, effortless for years to come.\r\n\r\nThe primary bedroom offers a walk in robe and ensuite, a lovely place to close the door on the day. Three further bedrooms give the children room to grow, or become a home office or guest room whenever life calls for it. A full bathroom and powder room complete the picture.\r\n \r\nMinimal garden. Generous double garage. Lock up and leave, whether for a weekend away or a month abroad.\r\n \r\nThen step out into Takapuna. Morning coffee in the village. A stroll around Lake Pupuke. A swim at the beach. Dinner along Hurstmere Road. Smales Farm and the motorway are close for an easy commute, and families will love the Westlake zoning.\r\n \r\nThe view. The light. The location. The life you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nWho lives in a house like this? You do. \r\n\r\nConstruction is complete and the Code Compliance Certificate is expected mid December 2026. \r\nExpressions of Interest close Wednesday 16 December 2026 at 4:00 p.m. (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\nContact Jackie or Kristina from PARKER | MARMONT, New Zealand Sotheby’s International Realty. \r\n\r\nAll conjunctionals welcome.",
